  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Averageemf, $\\mathrm{e}=\\frac{\\text { Changein flux }}{\\text { Time }}=-\\frac{\\Delta \\phi}{\\Delta \\mathrm{t}}$\n$=-\\frac{0-\\left(4 \\times(2.5 \\times 2) \\cos 60^{\\circ}\\right)}{10}=+1 \\mathrm{~V}$",
